[
  {
    "content_id": "10050001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保羅和提摩太是基督耶穌的奴僕，寫信給腓立比在基督耶穌裡的所有聖徒、諸位監督和執事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;願我們的父上帝和主耶穌基督賜給你們恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我每逢想起你們，就感謝我的上帝；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;每次為你們眾人禱告，心裡都帶著喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因為你們從最初直到現在，始終和我同心合意地傳揚福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我深信，上帝既然在你們心裡開始了這美好的工作，就必在耶穌基督再來的時候完成這工作。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我對你們眾人有這樣的感受很自然，因為我常把你們放在心上。不論我是身在獄中，還是為福音辯護和作證的時候，你們都與我同蒙恩典。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;上帝可以作證，我是怎樣以基督耶穌的慈心想念你們的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我所祈求的就是：你們的愛心隨著屬靈知識和辨別力的提高而日益增長，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;使你們能夠擇善而從，做誠實無過的人，一直到基督再來的日子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;並靠著耶穌基督結滿仁義的果子，使上帝得到榮耀與頌讚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，我希望你們知道，我的遭遇反而會使福音傳得更廣，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;連所有的皇家衛兵和其他眾人都知道我是為了基督的緣故而受囚禁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;大多數主內的弟兄姊妹因我被囚的緣故，就信心堅定，更加放膽傳揚上帝的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;當然，有些人宣講基督是出於嫉妒和爭強好勝，也有些人是出於善意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;後者是出於愛心，知道我是上帝派來為福音辯護的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;前者傳講基督是出於個人野心，動機不純，以為可以增加我在獄中的痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;那又怎樣呢？無論他們是出於真心還是假意，基督的福音畢竟被傳開了，因此我很歡喜，而且歡喜不已。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;因為我知道，藉著你們的禱告和耶穌基督之靈的幫助，我終必得到釋放。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我熱切期待和盼望：我不會感到任何羞愧，而是放膽無懼，不管是生是死，都要照常使基督在我身上被尊崇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;因為對我來說，活著是為了基督，死了也有益處。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;如果活在世上，我的工作肯定富有成果。我真不知道該怎麼選擇！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;我處在兩難之間。我情願離開世界，與基督在一起，那實在是再好不過了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;可是為了你們，我更有必要活在世上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;我既然對此深信不疑，就知道自己仍要活下去，繼續跟你們在一起，好使你們在信仰上又長進又充滿喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;這樣，我再到你們那裡的時候，你們可以因為我的緣故更加以基督耶穌為榮。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;最要緊的是：你們行事為人要與基督的福音相稱。這樣，不管是去看你們，還是只聽到你們的消息，我都能知道你們同心合意，堅定不移地一起為福音信仰奮鬥，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001028",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;毫不懼怕敵人的恐嚇。這是出於上帝的記號，表明他們必滅亡，你們必得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001029",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;因為上帝為了基督的緣故，賜恩使你們不但信基督，而且為祂受苦，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 1:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001030",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;經歷你們從前在我身上見過、現在又從我這裡聽到的同樣爭戰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;所以，你們如果在基督裡受到鼓勵，得到愛的安慰，與聖靈相通，有慈悲和憐憫之心，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;就要同心合意，彼此相愛，靈裡合一，思想一致，好讓我的喜樂滿溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;凡事不可自私自利、愛慕虛榮，要心存謙卑，看別人比自己強。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;各人不要只顧自己的事，也要顧別人的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們應當有基督耶穌那樣的心意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂雖然本質上是上帝， 卻不緊抓與上帝同等之位，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;反而甘願放下一切， 取了奴僕的形像， 降生為人的樣子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;祂以人的樣子出現後， 就自願卑微，順服至死， 而且死在十字架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因此，上帝將祂升為至尊， 賜給祂超乎萬名之上的名，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;使一切天上的、 地上的和地底下的， 無不屈膝跪拜在耶穌的名下，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;無不口稱耶穌基督是主， 將榮耀歸於父上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;所以，我親愛的弟兄姊妹，你們一向都很順服，不只是當著我的面時才順服，我不在時你們更加順服，要戰戰兢兢地活出你們的救恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因為你們立志和行事都是上帝在你們心中工作，為要成就祂美好的旨意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;無論做什麼事，都不要抱怨，也不要與人爭論，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;好使你們在這個扭曲乖謬的時代中清白無過，作上帝純潔無瑕的兒女，如同明光照耀在世上，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;堅守生命之道。這樣，到了基督再來的時候，我可以誇口自己沒有空跑一場，也沒有白費功夫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你們的信心就是獻給上帝的祭物，即使在上面澆奠我的生命，我也很喜樂，並且和大家一同喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;同樣，你們也要喜樂，要和我一同喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;靠著主耶穌，我希望儘快派提摩太去你們那裡，好知道你們的近況，使我也感到欣慰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;因為沒有人像他那樣跟我一同真正關心你們的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;別人都只顧自己的事，不顧耶穌基督的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但你們知道提摩太的為人，他與我在福音事工上一起服侍，情同父子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;所以，我的案子一旦明朗了，我會立刻派他去見你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;我靠主深信自己很快也會去你們那裡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;另外，我覺得有必要讓以巴弗提回到你們那裡。他是我的弟兄、同工和戰友，也是你們差遣來服侍我、供應我需用的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;他很想念你們各位，並且感到不安，因為你們聽說了他患病的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;他確實病了，幾乎喪命，但上帝憐憫了他，不但憐憫他，也憐憫了我，沒讓我憂上加憂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002028",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;所以，我想儘快派他回去與你們相聚，好讓你們喜樂，也可以減少我的掛慮。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002029",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;你們要在主裡歡歡喜喜地接待他，而且要敬重像他這樣的人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 2:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002030",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;因為他冒著生命危險彌補你們服侍我的不足之處，為了基督的工作幾乎喪命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;此外，弟兄姊妹，你們要靠主喜樂！我再把這些事寫給你們，對我來說並不麻煩，對你們卻是保障。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你們要提防那些犬類，提防那些作惡的人，提防那些鼓吹必須受割禮才能得救的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因為真正受割禮的人是我們這些靠著上帝的靈敬拜、以基督耶穌為榮、不倚靠自身條件的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;其實我也可以靠自身的條件。如果別人覺得可以靠自身的條件，我更可以。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我出生後第八天就受了割禮，我是以色列人，屬於便雅憫支派，是道道地地的希伯來人。論守律法，我是法利賽人；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;論熱心，我曾經迫害教會；論律法要求的義，我是無可指責的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;但是為了基督，我從前以為有價值的，現在認為毫無價值。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;不但如此，我看萬事都毫無價值，因為認識我主基督耶穌是最寶貴的。我為祂失去了一切，我把失去的一切視為糞土，好得到基督，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;與祂聯合。我並非擁有源於律法的義，而是擁有信靠基督而得的義。這義從上帝而來，以信為基礎。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我渴望認識基督和祂復活的大能，與祂一同受苦，甚至到死的地步，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;這樣我無論如何都可以從死裡復活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;這並不是說我已經得到了或者純全了，我還要竭力追求，或許可以達到基督耶穌要我達到的目標。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，我並非以為自己已經得到了，我只專注一件事，就是忘記背後，努力向前，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;直奔目標，要贏得上帝藉著基督耶穌從天上呼召我去得的獎賞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我們中間成熟的基督徒都應該有這樣的看法。即使你們有什麼不同看法，上帝也必讓你們明白。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;然而，我們長進到什麼程度，就照著什麼程度去行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，你們要一同效法我，也要向那些以我們為榜樣的人學習。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我已經多次告訴你們，現在又流著淚提醒你們：有許多人行事為人與基督的十字架為敵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他們的神就是自己的肚腹，他們以自己的羞恥為榮，只想著地上的事，他們的結局是滅亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我們卻是天上的國民，熱切等候從天降臨的救主，就是主耶穌基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;那時，祂要以降服萬物的大能將我們這卑賤的軀體改變成像祂那樣榮耀的身體。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我所親愛、所想念的弟兄姊妹，你們就是我的喜樂和冠冕。我親愛的弟兄姊妹，你們要靠主堅定不移。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我懇求友阿蝶和循都姬要在主裡同心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;信實的同工啊，請你幫助她們二人，因為她們曾與我、革利免和其他同工一起為福音辛勞，這些人的名字都在生命冊上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你們要靠主常常喜樂！我再說，你們要喜樂！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;要讓眾人都知道你們是謙和寬容的人。主快來了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們應該一無掛慮，凡事要藉著禱告和祈求，懷著感恩把你們的需要告訴上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;這樣，上帝那超越人所能理解的平安必在基督耶穌裡保守你們的心思意念。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;最後，弟兄姊妹，你們要思想一切真實、可敬、公義、純潔、可愛、有好名聲、有美德和值得讚許的事情。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你們從我身上學習、領受、看到和聽到的，都要付諸實踐。這樣，賜平安的上帝就必與你們同在。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我靠主非常喜樂，因為你們現在又一次關心我。其實你們向來都很關心我，只是沒有機會。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我並非因為缺乏才這樣說，因為我已經學會在任何處境中都能知足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我知道如何過貧窮的日子，也知道如何過富足的日子。我學到了秘訣，不論飽足或饑餓，豐裕或缺乏，在任何情況下都可以處之泰然。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;靠著賜我力量的那位，我凡事都能做。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;然而，你們與我共患難，真是美好。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;腓立比人啊！你們也知道，在我離開馬其頓傳福音的初期，除了你們以外，沒有別的教會供應我的需要。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;即使我在帖撒羅尼迦的時候，你們也不止一次供應過我的需要。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我不求得到饋贈，只求有更多成果歸在你們賬上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我現在樣樣都有，豐富有餘。我從以巴弗提手上收到了你們送給我的禮物，已經充足了。這些饋贈是蒙上帝悅納的馨香祭物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比書 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
